  id: scene_transitioner
  order: 0
  title: Scene Transitioner
  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 3ddf19e2fe79e614cb46c8eb16e5eaea, type: 3}
  shortDescription: "H\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 chuy\u1EC3n c\u1EA3nh trong game."
  fullDescription: "H\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 chuy\u1EC3n c\u1EA3nh trong game. Kh\xF4ng nh\u1EA5t
    thi\u1EBFt ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 chuy\u1EC3n Scene, chuy\u1EC3n c\u1EA3nh b\u1EA5t
    c\u1EE9 th\u1EE9 g\xEC.\n\n\n<b><size=15>1, \u0110\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o nhanh Scene
    Transitioner</size></b>\nChu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i trong scene/ZeroX/Scene Transitioner
    Template.\n\n<b><size=15>2, Singleton</size></b>\nTrong Scene Transitoner c\xF3
    m\u1EE5c <b>id</b> v\xE0 <b>Register With Manager</b>, c\xF3 t\xE1c d\u1EE5ng
    nh\u01B0 singleton, khi b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EB7t Scene Transitioner tr\xEAn scene
    v\xE0 Play th\xEC Scene Transitioner \u0111\xF3 s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c register
    nh\u01B0 id b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EB7t.\n\nV\xED d\u1EE5: b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EB7t
    id l\xE0 default v\xE0 register th\xE0nh c\xF4ng. Trong code b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3
    g\u1ECDi SceneTransitioner.Default \u0111\u1EC3 truy v\u1EA5n nhanh m\xE0 kh\xF4ng
    c\u1EA7n ph\u1EA3i ref\n\n\n<b><size=15>3, Setting</size></b>\nB\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng
    c\u1EA7n ph\u1EA3i k\xE9o t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 Scene Transitioner l\xEAn scene m\u1EDBi
    register \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c, ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n k\xE9o prefab v\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1n
    id v\xE0o trong danh s\xE1ch c\u1EE7a Setting l\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c\n"
  listRequiredSdkDefine: []
  listOptionalSdkDefine: []
